cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "frbpp: reproduction package for an isolated candidate same-source FRB pair in CHIME/FRB Catalogue 2"
message: "Cite the software release for the analysis; the companion paper reference is added on publication."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AC4S (AcerisCentreforScience)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AcerisCentreforScience/frbpp_clean"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
abstract: >-
  Point-process statistics engine and reproduction package. Contains the analysis library, one
  script per calculation step, the unit tests, the public catalogue inputs used, and the derived
  tables cited by the companion paper. A single command reproduces the published numbers from
  public data without network access.
keywords:
  - fast radio bursts
  - reproducibility
  - point process
  - dispersion measure
  - CHIME
